objection_type,user_message,ahmed_reply,total_s
Price,Itni mehngi property kyun hai? Mera budget kam hai.,"Acha sir, rates area aur property type ke hisaab se hote hain, ji. Hamaray paas 28 lakh mein bhi 1 bed flat available hain D17 aur Rawalpindi mein. Kya aap ko yeh options check karne hain?",1.385
Trust,Ye property genuine hai? Mujhe scam ka dar hai.,"Ji bilkul sir, pareshan na hon. Har property pehlay housing authority ke records se verify hoti hai aur booking se pehle ownership documents bhi check kiye jatay hain, aap chahen to khud bhi independently verify kar saktay hain. Bataiye, kis property ke baray mein maloomat chahtay hain?",1.529
Location,"Ye area theek nahi lag raha, developed nahi hai.","Bilkul sir, aisi baat nahi hai. Hamare paas jo properties hain, misal ke tor par Precinct 6 Karachi mein ready-to-move 5-bedroom DDL luxury villa hai jo main entrance se sirf 3km door hai aur wahan parks, masjid aur Midway Commercial bhi qareeb hain. Aapko kis specific area mein property chahiye?",1.23
Investment,Is mein investment karun to return milega?,"Hmm... ek minute, dekhta hoon. Ji sir, real estate mein investment ke returns market conditions pe depend karte hain, is liye hum koi guaranteed return ya profit promise nahi kar sakte. Acha, kya aap mazeed details ke liye koi property discuss karna chahenge?",1.051
Builder,Developer kaun hai? Unka track record kya hai?,"Ji sir, mere paas jo details hain us mein developer ka naam aur track record available nahi hai. Kya main aap ki call note kar ke yeh maloomat pata karwa loon?",1.361
Maintenance,Maintenance charge kitna hoga monthly?,"Hmm... Ji sir, maintenance charges society aur property size par depend karte hain—yeh aap ki pasand ki specific property ke liye confirm kiye ja sakte hain. Aap kis society ya property ke baare mein pooch rahe hain?",1.06
